include ../Common.buildvars

Assembly %_FileName
.run     | ..

Includes . .. ../TestFramework

DxLibraries d3d12 dxguid dinput8 dxgi d3dcompiler
Libraries %_NativeLibs $DxLibraries

Linker.Subsystem console

Depends ../Jolt          | %_args
Depends ../TestFramework | %_args

Assert.Platform Windows
Platform.*.errormessage
{
    JoltViewer currently does not support %(_platform). It is a Windows only application at this time.
}
